{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】日本東海道新幹線「希望號」及「瑞穗號」指定席，明年7月起加價。</p>\n<p>以東京到新大阪區間為例，普通車指定席費用上漲700日圓，至15420日圓，折合約766港元，是「希望號」1992年投入服務以來，除了調整消費稅稅率之外首次加價。</p>\n<p>公司指，通貨膨脹導致成本上升，加上提升服務品質所需的費用，所以需要加價。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:40:40.041380+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:21:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:14.551821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:14.551821+00:00","content_hash":"08a71f0f74eb5dc85e89e0c6e15812c5390ba079f20c6348e0ea094b6c885299","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}